rient<br>&gt;&gt; TV remote for Philips<br>&gt;&gt; TV remote for Xiaomi<br>&gt;&gt; TV remote for Changhong Ruba and many more.<br><br>How To universal remote control :<br>1. Download TV remote control for all app<br>2. Install it and then open the universal tv remote application<br>3. Select the device like TV, Ac, AVR, Set Top Box, and Camera etc.<br>4. Select the brand from the list<br>5. Choose remote for required device<br>6. Tap on the button in front of your device<br>7. Finish! Remote control is ready.<br><br>Universal Smart tv remote control Important :<br><br>If your smartphone do not have IR sensor then it also works over WIFI.<br>If you found any issue or Smart TV Remote for All is not working properly, please drop an email. So we can resolve issue for you as soon as possible.<br>Download and try this Smart TV Remote And universal remote. Thank you!",
